    <div class="zf-cb-text">
      {# Keep this copy in sync with the inlined banner in src/webinar-text/index.html (passthrough page). #}
      <strong>We use cookies.</strong> Essential cookies keep this site working. We also use analytics and advertising cookies (PostHog, Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, Google Ads) to improve our service and run ads. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
